[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11165.59, "timestamp": "03:06:05", "text": "无论如何，Everare诊所实行不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11168.63, "timestamp": "03:06:08", "text": "退款政策。 虽然她已是一具尸体"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11171.269, "timestamp": "03:06:11", "text": "，但我会履行承诺，为她更换"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11173.11, "timestamp": "03:06:13", "text": "眼角膜。 你能帮我把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11205.349, "timestamp": "03:06:45", "text": "。 丁叔叔，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11207.349, "timestamp": "03:06:47", "text": "箱子方方正正地放在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11209.429, "timestamp": "03:06:49", "text": "石桌上，一尘不染。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11212.23, "timestamp": "03:06:52", "text": "是的，这些东西不能长时间保存。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11215.67, "timestamp": "03:06:55", "text": "应该是最近有人送来的。   是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11218.63, "timestamp": "03:06:58", "text": "同一个人写的信。"}]